s the chain from failure through correction to re-measurement explicit.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/08dd3a898b57a4f0437501a4ad2f9345963e3371c4b5cb84aaef6ea4161fa827","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","contribution":"Write `specification/project-conformance.md` for a minimal CLI Hello World software-build traversal. It must state:\n- the Intent;\n- the Product boundary: a Node CLI with no package or network dependency;\n- source-grounded requirements;\n- completion criteria.\n\nThe source surface is `generated/hello-world.mjs`. The execution proof runs the CLI and observes stdout of exactly `Hello, world!\\n` with exit 0. Completion also requires both supplied component and UAT tests to execute the real CLI, with at least two passes and zero failures, backed by truthful admitted execution evidence rather than a prewritten report. Write no source, tests, package files or execution plans.","reason":"The file is absent, and the conformance obligation needs fresh substantive content grounded in the original conformance_project stage. The content does not depend on the CLI bytes. It is the authority for the implementation design.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/08dd3a898b57a4f0437501a4ad2f9345963e3371c4b5cb84aaef6ea4161fa827"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abio